<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/fn/AFA18-Footnote5.5> a ipbes:Footnote ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:AFA18 ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/AFA18-5.2.1> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "These search terms were chosen to limit results to studies that specifically mention scenarios, and anything to do with biodiversity or ecosystems, including ecosystem services. An exploratory search including additional terms such as “nature”, “contributions”, “well-being” or specific ecosystem service descriptors (e.g., “food”) resulted in a much larger set of studies, most of which were not relevant to this assessment. We thus chose to work with the narrower set of search terms." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Footnote5.5" .

