        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/AFA18-6.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Lambin, E. F., D’haen, S. A. L., Mertz, O., Nielsen, J.O., & Rasmussen, K. (2014). Scenarios on future land changes in the West African Sahel. Geografisk Tidsskrift-Danish Journal of Geography 114, 76–83. https://doi.org/10.1080/00167223.2013.878229" ;
