        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333070/items/3N99EUDX>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333070/items/57WJABFV>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333070/items/5S2JEES3>,
